<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Youth Cup</p>
<p>soccer matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group D:</p>
<p>Spain beat Japan 2-1 ( halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Spain -- Francisco Farisno 22, Miguel Angulo 55</p>
<p>Japan -- Atsushi Yanagisawa 66</p>
<p>Group E:</p>
<p>Argentina beat Hungary 3-0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Bernardo Romeo 9, Lionel Scaloni 42, Roman</p>
<p>Riquelme 50</p>
<p>Group F:</p>
<p>Mexico beat United Arab Emirates 5-0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Eduardo Lillingston 26, 55, Carlos Carino 40,</p>
<p>Gerardo Torres 60, Mendiola Omar Santacruz 71</p>
<p>Group D:</p>
<p>Costa Rica and Paraguay drew 1-1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Costa Rica -- Pablo Chincilla 45</p>
<p>Paraguay -- Raul Roman 58</p>
<p>Group E:</p>
<p>Australia and Canada drew 0-0</p>
<p>Group F:</p>
<p>England beat Ivory Coast 2-1 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>England -- Michael Owen 5, Paul Shepherd 68</p>
<p>Ivory Coast -- Souleymane Cisse 32</p>
</text>
